# Windows checkouts must not convert to CRLF: sdk.lock pins the vendored
# header by sha256 and --lmcode-schema --json is asserted byte-identical.
# text=auto leaves binary files alone: a bare "* eol=lf" forces every file
# to text, and would rewrite the \r\n inside the PNG signature on commit.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.dslb binary
